Synonym for Flow typing - the type checker is \"sensitive\" to control flow, tracking how conditionals, assignments, and predicates refine types at different program points.

Synonym for ${fref("/01-programming-language-theory/02-concepts/flow-typing.td")} - the type checker is "sensitive" to control flow, tracking how **conditionals**, **assignments**, and **predicates** refine types at different program points.
